t slipped out of a rented Maryland farmhouse with 21 followers and marched quietly toward the sleeping town of X five miles away. X sits at the confluence of the Shenandoah and Potomac rivers, perched at the bottom of a ravine where Thomas Jefferson once stood and called the view “one of the most stupendous scenes in nature.” Brown’s target was a federal armory containing 100,000 muskets and rifles. His plan was audacious: seize the weapons, arm enslaved people, and ignite a revolution that would destroy slavery forever. But it did not work. U.S. Marines under Colonel Y stormed the engine house where Brown’s party had barricaded themselves. The old man was beaten unconscious, tried for treason, and hanged. Among those present was Z, who watched the hanging as a spectator. Brown’s final note read: “I am now quite certain that the crimes of this guilty land will never be purged away but with blood.” Y later went on to lead Confederate forces in the ensuing Civil War and Z later took it upon himself to avenge the South’s defeat. ID X (10 points), Y (5 points), and Z (5 points).", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T15:06:18Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Y is Lee?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T15:06:25Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Z is Stonewall Jackson", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T15:06:37Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Z is boooth", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T15:06:38Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Harpers feery", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T15:06:42Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "*ferry", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-20T15:06:48Z